{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"「Game Boy Nintendo Classics」追加「Mole Mania」「Revenge of the 'Gator」「鬼追人」！\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b312bb27c2f7884ecd63ed01b1aec1ca6d7189b0748c75766d2b3a96d0294381/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2d2262079bc432ab40556f9af0d519f2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>「Game Boy Nintendo Classics」追加「Mole Mania」「Revenge of the 'Gator」「鬼追人」！</figcaption></figure><p>「<strong>Game Boy Nintendo Classics</strong>」將於 2026年10月27日(二) 起追加3款作品！<br/>「<strong>Mole Mania</strong>」「<strong>Revenge of the 'Gator</strong>」「<strong>鬼追人</strong>」登場。</p><h2>「Game Boy Nintendo Classics」追加3款作品！</h2><blockquote><p></p></blockquote><p>2026年10月27日(二)起，「Game Boy Nintendo Classics」追加3款作品。<br/>地上與地下來回穿梭的動作益智遊戲、滿是鱷魚的彈珠台、附身敵人前進的動作遊戲即將登場。</p><h3>介紹追加的3款作品</h3><h4>Mole Mania</h4><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334948/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"モグラ～ニャ\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4ae8f7aaab44c6a375939d6664907778fa546717f5d25ee72807a74d685699f0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcfcd523f929d6c317ba7a1fa3f9b78cf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>モグラ～ニャ</figcaption></a><p></p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334949/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"モグラ～ニャ\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8bcef0e5fb10bcb3f6c9385c281fefccafc66dbc02f3165c7215cb19cc69ecea/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F14c75df38774a5f9c6fc91ec8d6f42c2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>モグラ～ニャ</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334950/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"モグラ～ニャ\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f702fe546a8f4c66356155675a06cfd143d476d21b7cfaa87bdc6209e2d2beb2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa540f52fba9d7e13492eb9395720ca56.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>モグラ～ニャ</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334951/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"モグラ～ニャ\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c2ad2c250f1b3915be785f0b4581476faaa6def4b61deb92b5f70c91ebafdce6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fca785e69ad91fc770bb99a312dc745fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>モグラ～ニャ</figcaption></a><p>1996年由任天堂發售的動作益智遊戲。<br/>為了拯救被綁架的家人，主角Mole Mania前往「じんべえランド(jinbee樂園)」。<br/>挖掘地下並避開地上的障礙物，以各關卡的出口為目標。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><p>也收錄2人用的「VS模式」。<br/>輪流操作Mole Mania與jinbee，比賽誰能讓較多的高麗菜掉落。</p><h4>Revenge of the 'Gator</h4><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334952/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ピンボール 66匹のワニ大行進\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/65462c69467f8d6dacbcf267e3e565a8eb536e7b536c0aa057b811d4fdbdbd3f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F20264cf86adf36cbfa5bd2047d9c134b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>ピンボール 66匹のワニ大行進</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334953/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ピンボール 66匹のワニ大行進\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a1cf7d030c011cc6847d4f9b4c5e15ebde7e9fb76a5c96d76c5c06761d443a66/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F26856dbe04fea49f66a2cc40090530bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>ピンボール 66匹のワニ大行進</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334954/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ピンボール 66匹のワニ大行進\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/389f88b9b0e0a0449430331e3cb708f014d97b4afce7ab25a7ec41c09c008df7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb8f109e9f88601f9d3a392796dfd9b6e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>ピンボール 66匹のワニ大行進</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334955/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ピンボール 66匹のワニ大行進\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/669735b34a6ce8859d91b3c30f785627a0372da25bd7554f51409555eeae18d6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd3126b79852b21803197d3994a8f0e62.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>ピンボール 66匹のワニ大行進</figcaption></a><p>1989年由HAL研究所發售的彈珠台遊戲。<br/>將球打進特定洞口或鱷魚口中，即可前進獎勵關卡，以更高分為目標。</p><h4>鬼追人</h4><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334956/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ファンタズム\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dde95fbcb1d9136ed4bac5a575bd25bf8d1b326fa899510236b2e889defabeb5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8e478f644e76becb50bd2e8122b3211d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>ファンタズム</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334957/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ファンタズム\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/183498c1317d86c412bee9480c79d733655f51662da2a389094120078efa2f33/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0a10d9989cbf7bc72d1f8b429134b307.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>ファンタズム</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334958/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ファンタズム\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8e8bb726d2804e27b12c5e315c128f0c9ad46a89fb536b31437225984383cd93/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F70aad2d3ee2fdf5978403d3a46e122a8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>ファンタズム</figcaption></a><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/gameboy-nintendo-classics-3-titles-added-oct2026/334959/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ファンタズム\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e65718ecaf99bd9970973d5a4545b0ca548df8775160b561eeb71052a67c3db2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fdc39da365f595ff0464520b675a9fa19.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>ファンタズム</figcaption></a><p>1992年發售的動作遊戲。<br/>成為幽靈的主角為了拯救被囚禁的女友，附身到幫派分子、龍、機器人等敵人身上，運用各自的能力前進秘密結社的根據地。</p><p>各作品詳細資訊請確認<a href=\"https://www.nintendo.com/jp/topics/article/fb255ded-796c-40fa-b234-f062b3b06894\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nintendo Topics</a>。</p><blockquote><p></p><p>[トピックス]【10月27日追加】「ファミリーコンピュータ＆スーパーファミコン＆ゲームボーイ Nintendo Classics」に追加タイトルを配信開始。<a href=\"https://t.co/8qkMxqmFRn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/8qkMxqmFRnhttps://t.co/8qkMxqmFRn</a></p><p>— 任天堂株式会社 (@Nintendo) <a href=\"https://x.com/Nintendo/status/2113437642042040381?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">October 23, 2026</a></p></blockquote><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/nintendo-switch-online-free-trial-obakeidoro2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸Nintendo Switch Online 會員限定活動「試玩同樂會」開放《妖怪捉迷藏2》免費暢玩！10月26日至11月1日限時登場</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/fatalfury-cotw-nintendo-switch2-edition/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「餓狼傳說 CotW」Nintendo Switch 2版發售！收錄至Season Pass 3的Starter Edition也登場</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/op-restaurant/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「ONE PIECE 海洋盛宴」於Switch 2等平台發售！與草帽一行人經營餐廳</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/ffrs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「Final Fantasy Resonance」於10月22日發售！以HD-2D復甦的像素FF</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/nintendo-switch-sports-resort/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸體感運動系列最新作「Nintendo Switch Sports Resort」發售！在烏富島享受全12種運動吧</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:23:47.472851+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1232,"images":13,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:18:35.073929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:20.397058+00:00","content_hash":"c661594ecc230e8755842c8ba9066d440155f7553453d9cd5e9f32b07bbea39a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}